// "Coteau Citrouille": a hillside of pumpkins at dusk (issue #111, the 11th circuit), after the
// guide « Conception des circuits » (docs/GAME_DESIGN.md § 16). Original layout, about 1510 m a
// lap, turning right: the start straight in the pumpkin field, 10 m above the valley; two
// hairpins (right, left) up the hillside, a tight corner onto the top, east along it; the lacets
// of the top (a hairpin to the right, a hairpin to the left) up to the crest, 20 m up; the risky
// jump's corner (a tight corner to the right, its inside a drop, that a ramp crosses); down the
// hillside: a tight corner, the serpentine (a hairpin to the left, a hairpin to the right) down to
// the field; the bulge round a giant crooked pine, whose hidden road runs straight behind a stack
// of crates; the last corner, that the grass bridge crosses behind a curtain of tall grass. Six
// hairpins of 180° (a Normal bot drifts them), the bulge's S (left 75°, right 150°, left 75°),
// four tight corners of 90°: no long soft curve, one long straight. The pieces of the shortcuts
// (the jump's corner and its landing; the bulge, the last corner and their paths) are the
// Corniche Cannelle's (issues #107, #156: their gains and their hiding were tuned), with other
// covers; the rest is new.
//
// Drawn as a plan of straights and arcs, its points every 8 m along it (the parameters below
// follow them).
//
// Format: see src/track/data.rs. Point 0 is the start line; karts drive toward point 1 (north,
// -Z), then turn right. The grid sits on the straight behind point 0.
(
    name: "Coteau Citrouille",
    // Dressing (issue #11): the pumpkin hillside at dusk (`assets/data/biomes.ron`), the same every
    // time (seed), and pieces placed by hand: checkered flags at the start line, a giant crooked
    // pine that hides the hidden road, a giant carved pumpkin by the jump's corner.
    biome: "Citrouilles",
    // Issue #104: its music (`assets/data/music.ron`).
    music: "neon-sign-circuit",
    decor_seed: 111,
    props: [
        (model: "racing-kit/flagCheckers", at: 0.0, side: Both, height: 4.0, radius: 0.9, gap: 1.8),
        (model: "graveyard-kit/pine-crooked", at: 159.216, side: Right, height: 24.0, radius: 3.8, gap: 0.1),
        (model: "graveyard-kit/pumpkin-tall-carved", at: 92.204, side: Left, height: 14.0, radius: 6.0, gap: 2.0),
    ],
    checkpoint_spacing: 25.0,
